        {
          "text": "U-Amoni wayeneminyaka engamashumi amabili nambili ekuqaleni kwakhe ukubusa, wabusa iminyaka emibili eJerusalema; Igama likanina lalinguMesulemet, indodakazi kaHarusi, waseJotiba.",
